      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Just east of Hodges lies Dismal Canyon, a National Natural Landmark known for its diverse flora, fauna, and striking geological formations.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
